    {
      "role": "body",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "San Clemente is moving faster than most of South Orange County on market time, holding firmer on price, and closing at or above list. Among coastal peers, only Dana Point matches San Clemente on pricing discipline.",
      "href": null
